+# Slice 2 (AI Providers, Budgets, Autonomous Agents & Remote Runners): Phase 1 Inventory & Simplification Audit
+
+**Author:** s2-p1 (UX & Systems Security Auditor)  
+**Date:** 2026-11-25  
+**Tracking Ticket:** KAN-411 ([SLICE-2-P1][KB-AI-AUDIT])  
+**Parent Epic:** KAN-410 ([EPIC][SLICE-2-AI-AGENTS-RUNNERS])  
+**Requirement Traceability:** docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_PRODUCT_SPEC.md Section 9, Section 10, Section 11, Section 14  
+**Target Next Phase:** KAN-412 (Phase 2 Implementation)
+
+---
+
+## 1. Executive Summary & Audit Scope
+
+This document provides a setting-by-setting audit, UX simplification proposal, and phase handoff plan for **Slice 2: AI Providers, Token Caps, Autonomous Agents, Remote mTLS Runners & Local-Folder Onboarding**.
+
+The audit covers 100% of user-facing screens, drawers, modals, validation rules, and backend bindings across:
+- **Frontend Surfaces (8 components):**
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-ai/AiStudioPage.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-ai/AiProviderEditorDrawer.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-ai/AiBudgetModal.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-agents/AgentStudioPage.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-agents/AgentDefinitionEditorDrawer.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-agents/AgentValidationModal.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-runners/RunnerStudioPage.tsx`
+  - `kanban/web/src/features/admin-runners/MintEnrollmentTokenModal.tsx`
+- **Backend & CLI Components (5 modules):**
+  - `kanban/api/v1/admin/ai_providers.py`
+  - `kanban/api/v1/agent_definitions.py`
+  - `kanban/api/v1/remote_runners.py`
+  - `agent/remote_runner/cli.py`
+  - `kanban/ops/llms_txt.py`
+
+In accordance with Phase 1 instructions, zero source-code mutations were made during this audit.
+
+---
+
